<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#101d40">
<title>DAILY EARNERS - Earn Rewards Online</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6fc;color:#17233e}
header{background:#101d40;color:white;padding:22px 18px}
.brand{font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffd166}
header p{color:#dce6ff}
nav{display:flex;gap:20px;overflow-x:auto;padding:15px;background:white}
nav a{text-decoration:none;color:#17233e;white-space:nowrap}
main{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:20px}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#142c63,#087e8b);color:white;padding:28px 22px;border-radius:18px}
.hero h1{font-size:30px}
.hero p{line-height:1.7}
.button{display:inline-block;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:9px;background:#ffd166;color:#17233e;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}
h2{margin-top:28px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:14px}
.card{background:white;border:1px solid #e3e9f4;border-radius:13px;padding:18px}
.icon{font-size:28px}
.card h3{font-size:17px}
.card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#64718a}
.notice{background:#fff2d0;padding:15px;border-radius:10px;line-height:1.6;font-size:13px;margin-top:25px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;color:#64718a;font-size:13px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="brand">💰 DAILY EARNERS</div>
<p>Complete Tasks. Earn Rewards. Refer Friends.</p>
</header>
<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#tasks">Tasks</a>
<a href="#referrals">Referrals</a>
<a href="#how">How It Works</a>
</nav>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
<h1>Welcome to DAILY EARNERS!</h1>
<p>Discover online offers, complete eligible tasks, and earn rewards when your completions are confirmed. Invite friends and explore more opportunities.</p>
<a class="button" href="#tasks">Explore Tasks ↓</a>
</section>
<section id="tasks">
<h2>💎 Earning Opportunities</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><div class="icon">📱</div><h3>App Offers</h3><p>Discover app offers and earn when eligible tasks are confirmed.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">📝</div><h3>Surveys</h3><p>Find surveys and receive rewards for qualifying completions.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🎮</div><h3>Game Offers</h3><p>Explore games with reward opportunities.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🎁</div><h3>Special Offers</h3><p>Discover additional offers from participating providers.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="referrals">
<h2>👥 Invite Friends</h2>
<div class="card"><p>Invite friends to join DAILY EARNERS. Referral rewards will follow the published referral rules.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="how">
<h2>🚀 How It Works</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><div class="icon">1️⃣</div><h3>Create an Account</h3><p>Register when account services become available.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">2️⃣</div><h3>Complete Tasks</h3><p>Follow offer instructions and eligibility requirements.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">3️⃣</div><h3>Receive Rewards</h3><p>Eligible rewards are recorded after provider confirmation.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="notice"><strong>Important:</strong> This is the initial homepage. Registration, live offers, reward crediting, and withdrawals are not connected yet.</div>
</main>
<footer>© 2026 DAILY EARNERS. All rights reserved.</footer>
</body>
</html>
